                <pb facs="0520" n="396" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg396"/>

                <head>No. 216.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Noyes to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-02-21"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 21,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Short interview with minister for foreign affairs to-day. Have another to-morrow.
                    Nothing decisive. Minister says decree was issued under pressure of public
                    opinion. Shall insist firmly upon revocation.</p>
                <closer><signed>NOYES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
